1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,110
Listen to an announcement on a campus radio station.

2
00:00:03,110 --> 00:00:11,057
Man: Environmentally minded students will be happy to know that compost collection bins have been placed next to every paper

3
00:00:11,057 --> 00:00:15,030
and plastic recycling receptacle in the student center food court.

4
00:00:15,030 --> 00:00:19,160
Now, any uneaten food can be placed into a compost bin.

5
00:00:19,160 --> 00:00:23,503
The contents of the bins are collected daily by agriculture students

6
00:00:23,503 --> 00:00:29,030
who are transforming our food waste into plant food through the process of composting.

7
00:00:29,030 --> 00:00:35,090
Please do your part to keep our campus sustainable through recycling and composting.
